OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, in hospital after being
OL,4,Astruck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old girl remains in hospital
OL,7,Fwith life-threatening injuries after
OL,8,Fbeing struck by a car in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FStation Road, Hatton, just after 20:50
OL,12,FBST on Saturday, after the girl - who
OL,13,Fwas a pedestrian - was hit by the
OL,14,Fvehicle, a Toyota Aygo.
OL,16,FA Derbyshire Police spokesperson said
OL,17,Fthe teenager had suffered
OL,18,F"life-threatening injuries" and was
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital.
OL,21,FNo arrests have been made, the force
OL,22,Fadded, and investigations are ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
